    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Animal Way</h2></strong><br>Set on a serene island, this game invites you to cultivate your own farm while delving into a universe brimming with detail and opportunity. With a fusion of costumization, imagination, and exploration if you dream of crafting your own farm, exploring a vibrant realm, and making it yours down to every detail, then Animal Way is your ultimate destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Decorate Your Way:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fashion your abode, sculpt farm enclosures, and erect unique edifices that mirror your personality and tastes.<br></li><li>From quaint cottages to majestic manors, the possibilities are as boundless as your imagination.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Personalize Your Farm:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cultivate an array of crops and nurture livestock to cultivate a flourishing farmstead.<br></li><li>Utilize flexible building mechanics to craft a personalized haven, selecting from an array of construction materials and decorative elements.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Charming Pixel Universe:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a vibrant tapestry of scenic vistas and eclectic characters, all rendered in a delightful pixel art style.<br></li><li>Engage with an immersive ecosystem, where dynamic weather patterns influence your endeavors.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Animal Way</h2></strong><br>Set on a serene island, this game invites you to cultivate your own farm while delving into a universe brimming with detail and opportunity. With a fusion of costumization, imagination, and exploration if you dream of crafting your own farm, exploring a vibrant realm, and making it yours down to every detail, then Animal Way is your ultimate destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Decorate Your Way:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/4fafa12a9e06611f9e10d17e1509772b.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fashion your abode, sculpt farm enclosures, and erect unique edifices that mirror your personality and tastes.<br></li><li>From quaint cottages to majestic manors, the possibilities are as boundless as your imagination.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Personalize Your Farm:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/94da2f46d525456df9088fde59357d5e.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cultivate an array of crops and nurture livestock to cultivate a flourishing farmstead.<br></li><li>Utilize flexible building mechanics to craft a personalized haven, selecting from an array of construction materials and decorative elements.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Charming Pixel Universe:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.poster.avif?t=1724261984\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.webm?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619400/extras/9730d71d647dfad3a88c6470ed45b96e.mp4?t=1724261984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a vibrant tapestry of scenic vistas and eclectic characters, all rendered in a delightful pixel art style.<br></li><li>Engage with an immersive ecosystem, where dynamic weather patterns influence your endeavors.</li></ul>",
